                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alakwe mukwesu Apolo, ndakamukumbila loko kuti aze kukumuswaya antoomwe abakwesu bamwi, nekubaboobo takakayanda abuniini kuza kuciindi ecino, pele uleza ajana ciindi cibotu.",
